{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the impact of using imagenet_vit_l versus resnet50 image encoders with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and concat fusion. Validation accuracy (0.5321) is slightly lower than the previous scvi_n200 setup with resnet50 (0.5362), with similar F1 scores. This suggests the image encoder choice may influence performance, but the small difference and lack of unimodal baselines leave uncertainty about its significance and the role of other factors."
}

